<t>A profile of RFC 8439 for nish/crypto/chacha20poly1305: the ChaCha20
block and stream functions, Poly1305, its key generation and the
AEAD_CHACHA20_POLY1305 construction. Every requirement quotes RFC 8439, the
main source; every binding sentence of RFC 8439 (<bcp14>MUST</bcp14>, <bcp14>MUST NOT</bcp14>, <bcp14>SHALL</bcp14>, <bcp14>SHALL
NOT</bcp14>, <bcp14>REQUIRED</bcp14>) is tested or excluded here.</t>
    </abstract>
